---
import H from "@/components/H.astro";
import Layout from "@/layouts/PageLayout.astro";
import Section from "@/components/Section.astro";
---

<Layout>
    <H class="mb-4">
        Team V.A.N.
        <span slot="description">
            Team <i>Very Awesome Name</i> — FRC 12148
        </span>
    </H>

    <p>Student-led FIRST Robotics Competition (FRC) Team.</p>

    <Section>
        <H level="h2">What we do</H>
        <p>
            Founded this year, Team V.A.N. is dedicated to giving students
            hands-on experience in engineering, problem solving, and most
            importantly, decisionmaking and leadership.
        </p>
        <p>
            Our goal is to allow students to control and manage every aspect of
            the team, from the sponsorships and fundraising to critical design
            decisions of the robot.
        </p>
        <p>
            In participating with our team, students learn how to design, build,
            and program industrial-size robots while developing business,
            marketing, and presentation skills.
        </p>
    </Section>
</Layout>
